    <node id="PERSAN FARMA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">PERSAN FARMA is a pharmaceutical company actively involved in the field of clinical nutrition, particularly focusing on diabetes mellitus and its associated chronic conditions. The company has sponsored various events, including a round table on nutritional diagnosis and treatment for patients with diabetes, as well as scientific forums that discuss clinical cases. In Spain, PERSAN FARMA has also supported clinical case conferences that emphasize the importance of nutrition in managing diabetes.

The company is represented by a logo featuring an orange four-leaf clover or flower-like symbol, which reflects its identity within the pharmaceutical industry. PERSAN FARMA is dedicated to enhancing the training of healthcare professionals in clinical nutrition through its scientific projects and publications. Additionally, it sponsors publications aimed at improving training in nutritional therapy for various pathologies related to diabetes mellitus, demonstrating its commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in this critical area of healthcare.</data>
      <data key="d2">234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,2eff7eb5e1b3c24a5650d80b185fbd96,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396,a5ee3f91f8571820c338a8db4d3db09d,a86e44ac34c096cea172895339d5f733,daed781ebc502b854582efdef23e9dde</data>
