      <data key="d1">Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Cl&#237;nico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. He is particularly involved in managing nutritional support for patients with pancreatic tumors, demonstrating his expertise in both endocrinology and nutrition within a clinical setting.</data>
