      <data key="d1">Dra. M&#170; Victoria Garc&#237;a Zafra is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital General Universitario Santa Luc&#237;a in Cartagena. She is recognized for her work in providing nutritional support, particularly for patients with complex conditions such as MELAS syndrome and diabetes. As an author of one of the clinical cases presented, she emphasizes the importance of tailored nutritional interventions in managing these intricate health issues.</data>
