      <data key="d1">Dra. &#193;ngela Gonz&#225;lez D&#237;az-Faes is a medical professional specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Marqu&#233;s de Valdecilla in Cantabria. She manages nutritional care for patients with diabetes and other related conditions, providing essential nutritional support specifically for diabetic patients suffering from head and neck cancer. Her expertise encompasses a comprehensive approach to nutritional management, ensuring that her patients receive tailored care to address their unique health needs.</data>
