    <node id="DR. JUAN FRANCISCO MERINO TORRES">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres is a distinguished medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. He serves as the head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition department at Hospital Universitario y Polit&#233;cnico La Fe in Valencia, where he also holds the position of director cient&#237;fico. Dr. Merino Torres is recognized for his expertise in the field, particularly in relation to diabetes mellitus, and has contributed to the medical community through various published articles on the subject. His leadership at the hospital underscores his commitment to advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine and nutritional disorders.</data>
