    <node id="DR. CHRISTIAN SALOM VENDRELL">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Christian Salom Vendrell is a medical doctor specializing in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset in Valencia. He focuses on providing nutritional support for patients with head and neck cancer, demonstrating his expertise in managing the dietary needs of this specific patient population. Additionally, he has been involved in clinical cases, including enteral nutrition for a diabetic patient diagnosed with laryngeal squamous cell carcinoma. Through his work, Dr. Vendrell plays a crucial role in integrating nutritional care into the treatment plans for patients facing complex health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">0977493109f1215441cf1927961d21ee,234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,2eff7eb5e1b3c24a5650d80b185fbd96,34fd1f99a5ed706146b0a6a4db494afc</data>
