    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N CL&#205;NICA refers to the field of clinical nutrition, which encompasses the assessment and management of dietary needs and nutritional therapy for patients with a variety of health conditions. This discipline applies nutritional knowledge to effectively manage patients' dietary requirements within clinical settings, ensuring that individuals receive appropriate nutritional support tailored to their specific health issues.</data>
