    <node id="PREDYCES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">PREDYCES is a comprehensive study conducted in hospitals across Spain, focusing on the nutritional status of oncology patients and assessing the prevalence of disease-related malnutrition among this demographic. The research revealed significant rates of malnutrition both upon admission and discharge of patients. Additionally, the PREDYCES study involved the nutritional assessment of diabetic patients in 50 hospitals, further highlighting the critical issue of malnutrition in hospitalized individuals. Overall, PREDYCES underscores the urgent need to address malnutrition in oncology and diabetic patients within the hospital setting.</data>
      <data key="d2">3ed179f6e734d9fe4921fb0be0b018e4,45c3281fd6beffb0e9ac61ae5700af3d,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,f2846d08229fda837153207946e29831</data>
