      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">82</data>
      <data key="d7">34e0d13f06824b4996f261360999519b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EUROPE">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Europe is a continent facing several significant health concerns, including a high prevalence of diabetes, which affects millions of individuals. Additionally, disease-related malnutrition is a major public health issue within the region. Furthermore, Europe has been the focus of various studies and surveys related to cystic fibrosis, highlighting the continent's ongoing efforts to address and understand these health challenges.</data>
      <data key="d2">1e997b2a6bf1c926a7a17d8b5ac1e699,45c3281fd6beffb0e9ac61ae5700af3d,dec6b3fc008edd47758cfc00106d077b</data>
