    </node>
    <node id="COHORT DE DIABETES MELLITUS DE CASTILLA Y LE&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Diabetes Mellitus Cohort of Castilla y Le&#243;n is a study initiated in 2000 to track new diabetes diagnoses and their long-term health impacts.</data>
      <data key="d2">fc8df7c3d7a0d2286c55493077ed3937</data>
      <data key="d3">4</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">112</data>
      <data key="d7">82d791783f7a42899ab620c455aecc0b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Diabetes is a chronic medical condition that significantly affects how the body processes blood sugar (glucose). It requires careful management, including specific nutritional strategies and often the use of insulin. The condition is characterized by high blood sugar levels and can lead to various complications, including an increased risk of developing pancreatic cancer and complicating the management of conditions such as pancreatitis. 

Diabetes has substantial implications for public health, healthcare costs, and patient resources, particularly in regions like Spain. It is also associated with other health issues, such as MELAS syndrome, which can arise from insulin resistance and deficiency. Furthermore, diabetes can contribute to serious health problems, including obesity, if not well controlled. Lifestyle changes and medical interventions are crucial for prevention and management, highlighting the importance of ongoing attention to this chronic disease.</data>
      <data key="d2">178140d0d29364593546d7d21393f2c6,1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,1e997b2a6bf1c926a7a17d8b5ac1e699,3dfc700a2eaec232c05b0a53f2089229,514518b96e32b025815b45cc2a504f0d,5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b,67f96f3e5c366f82de31f1bf189aa71f,7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead,76c4ef07f382585bf943bfaf57372c86,7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada,7f3fb444fd8d5532fb968747a3b176c0,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,ac8c5a07bd415723c0410ec34b9d7c5e,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3,bfdbf41efa08067d5ae1b1a67830affd,d2e2009d967ecd49af312dba4e2ed4fd,da2707b26ddb548995a6d0e2a3eeddb0,e3370b71146ad5063d6b1e9c3d8a3bd2,e36c9b09870e14d19aa6eb7c82514499,f2846d08229fda837153207946e29831,fc8df7c3d7a0d2286c55493077ed3937</data>
