    <node id="ESPANA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Spain, known as "ESPANA," is a country that has been experiencing a general decrease in diabetes mortality rates, although this trend contrasts with the situation in the region of Castilla y Le&#243;n, where the rates may not reflect the same improvement. Additionally, Spain is actively engaged in studies focused on diabetes prevalence and healthcare costs, which underscore the socio-economic impact of diabetes on its population. These efforts indicate a commitment to understanding and addressing the challenges posed by diabetes within the country.</data>
