      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Dr. Alejandro Sanz Par&#237;s is a medical professional specializing in nutrition and dietetics, with a focus on diabetes care at Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza. He serves as the technical director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at the hospital, where he plays a crucial role in managing and overseeing nutritional care for patients.</data>
