    <node id="MEDICARE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Medicare is a U.S. federal health insurance program that provides coverage primarily for individuals aged 65 and older, as well as some younger individuals with disabilities. The program is designed to assist with healthcare costs and has been involved in studies related to various health conditions, including diabetes and malnutrition. Medicare offers essential support for individuals with diabetes and other medical conditions, ensuring access to necessary healthcare services.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,36c1edffe986e2f70996b6e440e11213</data>
