    <node id="MALNUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrici&#243;n is a condition that affects individuals, characterized by an inadequate intake of nutrients. It occurs when a person's diet fails to provide sufficient nutrients, which is particularly concerning for diabetic patients, especially in geriatric care. Malnutrici&#243;n related to disease is a significant issue in hospitalized patients with diabetes, as it can adversely impact morbidity and mortality rates.</data>
      <data key="d2">1ba0aa1d1330351a62eb6319ffdd30db,5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3,bd3162e408d0d1ddd770ea833aad5ff3</data>
