    </node>
    <node id="MALNUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Malnutrition is a condition that arises from an unbalanced diet and can significantly impact various patient populations. It is particularly concerning for individuals with MELAS syndrome, as their specific nutritional needs must be carefully managed to prevent complications. Additionally, malnutrition is a critical issue for diabetic patients, especially among the elderly, who may face unique dietary challenges. This condition has been the subject of numerous studies aimed at understanding its effects and finding effective interventions for those at risk.</data>
      <data key="d2">d52ef4e5955918a8a47b697fcdb4096f,e3370b71146ad5063d6b1e9c3d8a3bd2</data>
      <data key="d3">3</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">167</data>
      <data key="d7">1edcd5c19abc4717863119809f02dd65</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF CLINICAL ENDOCRINOLOGISTS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists is a professional organization that provides guidelines and consensus statements on diabetes management.</data>
      <data key="d2">d52ef4e5955918a8a47b697fcdb4096f</data>
      <data key="d5">0</data>
      <data key="d6">168</data>
      <data key="d7">3f17f83e8467427dbd698b1003a26c61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AMERICAN DIABETES ASSOCIATION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The American Diabetes Association is a prominent organization dedicated to diabetes care and research. It plays a crucial role in providing guidelines and recommendations for effective diabetes management. Additionally, the association is involved in diabetes research and education, offering valuable resources to support individuals and healthcare professionals in managing diabetes effectively.</data>
      <data key="d2">58db9fa69ca87ec24d7117fea6f2fe88,d52ef4e5955918a8a47b697fcdb4096f</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
