    <node id="ENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Enteral nutrition is a method of delivering nutrition directly to the stomach or intestines, primarily utilized in patients with specific health conditions. This approach leverages the gastrointestinal tract to provide essential nutrients, ensuring that individuals who may be unable to consume food orally still receive adequate nourishment.</data>
