    <node id="COSTE DE LA DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COSTE DE LA DIABETES refers to the economic impact and healthcare costs associated with diabetes management and treatment. The economic cost of diabetes and its interventions is significant, estimated to reach 11.6% of global health expenditure. This issue is particularly notable in Spain, where the financial burden of diabetes is felt acutely, highlighting the importance of addressing the economic implications of this chronic condition.</data>
