    <node id="OBESIDAD">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Obesidad, or obesity, is a chronic condition characterized by an excess accumulation of body fat, which significantly increases the risk of developing diabetes. It complicates nutritional assessment and is associated with a certain degree of inflammation. Due to its health implications, obesity is a critical target for preventive interventions aimed at reducing its prevalence and associated health risks.</data>
