    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0" />
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N encompasses the essential dietary management and support provided to patients, particularly those facing significant health challenges such as cancer and diabetes. It plays a vital role in preventing conditions like cachexia, improving the quality of life for cancer patients, and is a critical focus in the management of diabetes. Nutritional assessment and intervention are crucial for recovery, especially following surgery, and are integral to addressing specific health conditions. For patients with MNGIE, nutritional support becomes even more important, particularly for those experiencing substantial weight loss and gastrointestinal issues. Overall, NUTRICI&#211;N is dedicated to offering comprehensive dietary assistance to patients, particularly in cases of malnutrition and other related health concerns.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,514518b96e32b025815b45cc2a504f0d,5f4610a3d5efde69d7f34ec14c4bed0b,763c8ac63b4c91616bcea6f1f4aa38c9,7949b821c1ca2e4adc524e7775626396,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,acd36e6dbcd98757c4cf33ff090764ee,b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47,b7a2c1e4dd77f47605fdb33f4a2c2bdf</data>
