    </node>
    <node id="INSULINA GLARGINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulina Glargina is a long-acting insulin utilized by patients for the management of diabetes. It is administered at night and is specifically designed to help control blood sugar levels effectively. This insulin plays a crucial role in managing blood glucose levels in diabetic patients, including those with type 2 diabetes. Additionally, Insulina Glargina is noted for its use in managing diabetes post-surgery and is also mentioned in the context of nutritional therapy for patients with Alzheimer's disease. Overall, Insulina Glargina serves as an essential medication for maintaining optimal blood sugar control in various patient scenarios.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,39ea441f219d949e8bc3c6f430970689,59fd1772b0c4b6c23c975977be6a60fe,76c4ef07f382585bf943bfaf57372c86,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451,bfdbf41efa08067d5ae1b1a67830affd,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b,e7df0ed14559db764d393fb9411fec33</data>
