    <node id="NUTRITIONAL STATUS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional status refers to the condition of a person's health as it relates to the intake and utilization of nutrients. It encompasses the overall state of the body in relation to these nutrients, which is essential for maintaining health and managing various medical conditions, including MELAS syndrome. Understanding nutritional status is crucial for ensuring that individuals receive the necessary nutrients for optimal health and effective management of specific health issues.</data>
      <data key="d2">6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,e3370b71146ad5063d6b1e9c3d8a3bd2</data>
