    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL TOTAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N ENTERAL TOTAL, also known as total enteral nutrition, is a method of feeding that delivers all nutritional requirements directly through the gastrointestinal tract. This approach was specifically implemented for a patient following bariatric surgery due to complications that arose during the recovery process.</data>
      <data key="d2">67f96f3e5c366f82de31f1bf189aa71f,e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a</data>
      <data key="d3">14</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">393</data>
      <data key="d7">936ca77fba7049f7b953698233423200</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL TOTAL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL TOTAL, also known as Total Parenteral Nutrition (TPN), is a treatment designed to deliver nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the gastrointestinal tract. This method is particularly utilized for patients who are unable to consume food orally. In the case of a specific patient, TPN was initiated following the loss of a nasoenteric tube and prior to the resumption of oral feeding. During the patient's hospitalization, TPN served as a crucial means of providing nutritional support, ensuring that the necessary nutrients were supplied directly into the bloodstream to meet the patient's dietary needs.</data>
      <data key="d2">17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,a633c156fb0077e3f669d8eb258be944,e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">21</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">394</data>
      <data key="d7">dd97e4334527428e9cd1389ece43b275</data>
    </node>
