    <node id="ATORVASTATINA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Atorvastatin is a medication that the patient takes to manage dyslipidemia and lower cholesterol levels. It is utilized by the patient for the control of blood lipids, indicating its role in maintaining healthy cholesterol levels and overall cardiovascular health.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,3356667d6f35de6a8587ece00f8c6580,39ea441f219d949e8bc3c6f430970689</data>
