    </node>
    <node id="FEDERACI&#211;N INTERNACIONAL DE DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Federaci&#243;n Internacional de Diabetes (IDF) is an organization dedicated to establishing guidelines and recommendations for the treatment of diabetes. It plays a crucial role in providing guidance on various aspects of diabetes management, including the consideration of metabolic surgery for patients suffering from morbid obesity. Through its efforts, the IDF aims to improve the care and outcomes for individuals affected by diabetes worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d2">445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">7</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">414</data>
      <data key="d7">9b4deb94eb494e4d85506befcfa0d71b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CONTROL GLUC&#201;MICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Control gluc&#233;mico refers to the management and regulation of a patient's blood glucose levels throughout their treatment. It is a crucial aspect of patient care, particularly involving the administration of insulin to effectively manage blood glucose levels. In the context of treatment with NET (Nutritional Enteral Therapy) and NPT (Nutritional Parenteral Therapy), the control gluc&#233;mico was noted to be adequate, ensuring that the patient's glucose levels were maintained within a desirable range during their treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,4681f41ebd69a732f7a8be6c2ed0f51a,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">0</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">415</data>
      <data key="d7">c736da76d20342e9964ac1e18a747639</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TRATAMIENTO M&#201;DICO INTENSIVO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El tratamiento m&#233;dico intensivo se refiere a las intervenciones m&#233;dicas que se aplican a la paciente para el control de la diabetes tipo 2, complementando la cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica.</data>
      <data key="d2">efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">14</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">416</data>
      <data key="d7">37c7c0718680474295aec3d156edd6d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ESTUDIO STAMPEDE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">El estudio STAMPEDE es una investigaci&#243;n que demuestra la efectividad de la cirug&#237;a bari&#225;trica en el control gluc&#233;mico en pacientes obesos con diabetes tipo 2.</data>
      <data key="d2">efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
      <data key="d3">14</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">417</data>
      <data key="d7">27df6cb4ccd64922aa63a5616e9af2cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ASOCIACI&#211;N AMERICANA DE DIABETES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Asociaci&#243;n Americana de Diabetes (ADA) provides recommendations for diabetes management, including the possibility of surgery for certain patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce</data>
      <data key="d3">7</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
      <data key="d6">418</data>
      <data key="d7">1da4222e9db647b2bb456dfbee02fe88</data>
    </node>
    <node id="SOCIEDAD ESPA&#209;OLA PARA EL ESTUDIO DE LA OBESIDAD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sociedad Espa&#241;ola para el Estudio de la Obesidad is a society that provides criteria for evaluating the results of metabolic surgery.</data>
      <data key="d2">445e6aeaae0e8edb3faf2d36be2073ce</data>
