    <node id="L-CARNITINA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">L-Carnitine is a supplement that may be beneficial in managing symptoms for patients with mitochondrial diseases, such as MNGIE. Additionally, it has the potential to increase body weight and enhance the quality of life for cancer patients.</data>
      <data key="d2">763c8ac63b4c91616bcea6f1f4aa38c9,da58ef987e74d508eb95395230f21cdc</data>
