    </node>
    <node id="SITAGLIPTINA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Sitagliptin is an oral antidiabetic medication utilized in the treatment regimen for patients with MNGIE (Mitochondrial Neurogastrointestinal Encephalomyopathy) as well as for controlling blood sugar levels in individuals with type 2 diabetes. This medication helps manage blood glucose levels effectively, making it a valuable option for patients requiring diabetes management.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,763c8ac63b4c91616bcea6f1f4aa38c9</data>
