    </node>
    <node id="TRASPLANTE HEP&#193;TICO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "TRASPLANTE HEP&#193;TICO" refers to a liver transplantation procedure that was performed in September 2003 without complications, as part of the treatment for the patient's health issues. However, it was also noted that liver transplantation was evaluated as a treatment option for the patient with MNGIE (Mitochondrial Neurogastrointestinal Encephalomyopathy) but was ultimately deemed unsuitable. This indicates that while the transplantation was successfully carried out in 2003, it was not considered an appropriate option for the specific condition of MNGIE.</data>
      <data key="d2">0c6c9eb4aba5c4642a75d76bd7ea08ba,763c8ac63b4c91616bcea6f1f4aa38c9</data>
      <data key="d3">0</data>
