    </node>
    <node id="ZINC">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Zinc is a crucial micronutrient that plays a significant role in various bodily functions. It is particularly important for patients with cystic fibrosis, as monitoring zinc levels in these individuals helps prevent deficiencies. Deficiency in zinc can lead to various health issues, making it essential for maintaining overall health and well-being.</data>
      <data key="d2">3f295222427803a7fc92b83386e5ec56,933d6526b2d313c95c9f4aaa950a62a3</data>
      <data key="d3">0</data>
