    </node>
    <node id="PARENTERAL NUTRITION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Parenteral nutrition is a method of delivering nutrients directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the gastrointestinal tract, often used in patients with severe conditions like acute pancreatitis.</data>
