    <node id="NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Nutritional assessment is a comprehensive process aimed at evaluating a patient's nutritional status and needs. This evaluation often employs various tools, such as the Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA), to gather relevant data. The primary goal of nutritional assessment is to guide dietary and nutritional interventions tailored to the individual patient. It involves a thorough examination of the patient's dietary habits and nutritional requirements, ensuring that any treatment plans are effectively aligned with their specific needs. Overall, nutritional assessment serves as a critical step in understanding and addressing a patient's nutritional health.</data>
      <data key="d2">6935432f69970131a6485f38e3f06003,7a6970183393c5ef1adc99851ef3eada,84e91b50850bfa0ad0122cdebf477a1d,aeb399b3f90c6a50eed8adfa8a140451</data>
