    <node id="UNCYD">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">UNCyD, or Unidad de Nutrici&#243;n Cl&#237;nica y Diet&#233;tica, is a clinical nutrition unit dedicated to conducting nutritional assessments and screenings, particularly for patients over the age of 65. This institution operates within a collaborative team environment, offering nutritional support tailored to patients with special needs. Through its comprehensive approach, UNCyD aims to enhance the nutritional well-being of its patients, ensuring they receive the necessary care and resources to address their specific dietary requirements.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,7469cc60475806b519e91abe2796aead,76c4ef07f382585bf943bfaf57372c86,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
      <data key="d3">4</data>
