      <data key="d1">Alteplasa is a medication utilized for fibrinolysis in patients experiencing ischemic stroke, aiding in the dissolution of blood clots. Specifically, alteplase is indicated for thrombolysis in acute ischemic stroke cases. However, in certain situations, such as with specific patients, the administration of alteplase may need to be interrupted shortly after it begins.</data>
      <data key="d2">2f91f92c99da813a8d1be2f6ac0fa552,ea7d8ba0550547d4cff0b5d18c3f6ae5</data>
