      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "CIRCUNFERENCIA BRAQUIAL" refers to the measurement of the upper arm, specifically the circumference of the brachial area. This measurement is utilized to assess muscle mass and nutritional status in patients. It plays a significant role during nutritional assessments, providing valuable information regarding an individual's health and nutritional needs.</data>
