    <node id="VALENCIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Valencia is a city in Spain that is home to several important medical institutions, including the Hospital Universitario Doctor Peset and the Hospital Universitario y Polit&#233;cnico de La Fe. These hospitals serve as key healthcare facilities in the region, contributing to the city's reputation as a center for medical care and education.</data>
