    </node>
    <node id="INSULINA LISPRO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Insulina lispro is a rapid-acting insulin utilized by patients as needed for the management of blood sugar levels, particularly during meals. This insulin formulation is designed to help control glucose levels effectively, making it an essential component in the treatment of diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d2">bfdbf41efa08067d5ae1b1a67830affd,c3975fe03d2af26b95b09795c7769e8b</data>
