    </node>
    <node id="ACETATO DE MEGESTROL">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Acetato de megestrol is a medication that is prescribed to increase appetite in patients. It was specifically prescribed to a patient in 2011, and it demonstrated positive effects in enhancing appetite in the subsequent years.</data>
