    <node id="ASPEN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ASPEN, the American Society for Parenteral and Enteral Nutrition, is an organization dedicated to providing comprehensive guidelines on the screening and management of malnutrition in patients, with a particular focus on those in the oncological context. The organization plays a crucial role in establishing standards for nutritional support, especially for patients who require parenteral nutrition. Through its efforts, ASPEN aims to enhance the quality of care for individuals facing nutritional challenges due to medical conditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe</data>
