    </node>
    <node id="CARCINOMA EPIDERMOIDE DE LARINGE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Carcinoma epidermoide de laringe is a type of cancer that affects the larynx. It is commonly observed in patients with neoplasms of the head and neck. The patient has been diagnosed with this condition and is currently undergoing treatment for it.</data>
      <data key="d2">0b901814a09392d24880be465dcbce6f,3a1d1c4eb34995d440bd72c4b64e3c8d,e474ebdcd3e5392e4b2bed8434293849</data>
      <data key="d3">10</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">968</data>
      <data key="d7">94e33306d36244498e69102259c765ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GASTROSTOM&#205;A RADIOL&#211;GICA PERCUT&#193;NEA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Gastrostom&#237;a radiol&#243;gica percut&#225;nea is a procedure performed on the patient to assist with feeding due to his condition.</data>
      <data key="d2">3a1d1c4eb34995d440bd72c4b64e3c8d</data>
