    <node id="H&#205;GADO">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">H&#237;gado (Liver) is a vital organ where lesions were detected during the patient's imaging studies, suggesting potential metastasis. This organ is susceptible to various diseases, including cancer, and plays a crucial role in metabolic processes, such as the regulation of blood sugar levels. During an urgent ultrasound examination, four nodules were identified in the liver, further indicating the need for medical evaluation and potential intervention.</data>
      <data key="d2">b00c312f46e790b32fe99743480f9e47,c55f34a09dbf07224c85384f08173e27,cba5d81f1acff7cbf84e85ef35420521</data>
