    <node id="SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "SONDA DE GASTROSTOM&#205;A" is a medical device designed to facilitate enteral nutrition for patients. It allows for direct feeding into the stomach, making it particularly useful for individuals who have difficulties consuming food orally. This percutaneous gastrostomy tube is employed to provide essential nutrition to patients who are unable to maintain an adequate nutritional status through oral intake.</data>
      <data key="d2">5549895a3a7f54651e6c54f5a5d7d833,82d36ebbaaa026c713df2b7a47253efa,ce4c057e0a625bc9e64301a0cca1e206</data>
