      <data key="d1">The "SONDA DE GASTROYEYUNOSTOM&#205;A" is a medical device specifically designed for the administration of enteral nutrition. It is utilized in the treatment of patients who require long-term nutritional support. This device plays a crucial role in ensuring that patients receive the necessary nutrients when they are unable to consume food orally.</data>
