      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Adenocarcinoma pancre&#225;tico ductal is the most common form of pancreatic cancer, known for its aggressive nature and low survival rates.</data>
      <data key="d2">a960ccbf15a28151d1461c4203408408</data>
