    </node>
    <node id="ANEMIA">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Anemia is a medical condition characterized by a deficiency of red blood cells or hemoglobin in the blood. This condition can occur in cancer patients and may present various symptoms that require monitoring and treatment. In the context of patient care, anemia is a condition that patients may experience and is often addressed during their follow-up treatment.</data>
      <data key="d2">83b82871866963bb43f901dd9ca09fcb,a960ccbf15a28151d1461c4203408408</data>
      <data key="d3">10</data>
