    </edge>
    <edge source="PERSAN FARMA" target="MESA REDONDA DE CASOS CL&#205;NICOS">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">PERSAN FARMA is an organization that actively sponsors events focused on healthcare and medical education. Notably, they sponsored the "MESA REDONDA DE CASOS CL&#205;NICOS," a round table event dedicated to discussing nutritional diagnosis and treatment for diabetes patients. Additionally, PERSAN FARMA supported scientific forums that were related to the clinical cases presented during these discussions, highlighting their commitment to advancing knowledge and practices in the field of diabetes care.</data>
      <data key="d10">234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,a86e44ac34c096cea172895339d5f733</data>
      <data key="d11">89bff394ecf545e6b09c61e6e308129e</data>
      <data key="d12">2</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
