      <data key="d8">17.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Dr. &#193;ngel Luis Abad Gonz&#225;lez is a medical specialist at Hospital General Universitario de Alicante, where he specializes in endocrinology and nutrition.</data>
      <data key="d10">234b514a40a64bc02f1346cb62cf3f97,2eff7eb5e1b3c24a5650d80b185fbd96</data>
