    <edge source="DIABETES MELLITUS" target="S&#205;NDROME DE MELAS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Patients with MELAS often develop diabetes mellitus as a complication of the syndrome, necessitating specialized nutritional support.</data>
      <data key="d10">8b074745f27ee51afc8337a49fafacfa</data>
