      <data key="d8">59.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient has been receiving insulin as a critical component of their treatment for Type 1 diabetes, aimed at controlling elevated blood glucose levels. Following their diabetes diagnosis, the patient's insulin levels were adjusted to better manage their condition. However, it has been noted that the patient has been omitting doses of insulin, which is essential for effectively managing their diabetes. Overall, insulin plays a vital role in the patient's treatment plan to maintain stable glucose levels.</data>
