      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient has been diagnosed with diabetes mellitus type 2, which significantly influences her clinical management and overall health status. This condition has complicated her treatment, ultimately leading to the decision for bariatric surgery. The diagnosis of type 2 diabetes mellitus was confirmed during her hospitalization, highlighting the challenges she faces in managing her health effectively.</data>
      <data key="d10">449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,4b4f297dec86d7f65e362ad688bbb28f,e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
