    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="OBESIDAD M&#211;RBIDA">
      <data key="d8">27.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient suffers from morbid obesity, a significant health concern that has necessitated surgical intervention. This condition led to the decision to perform bariatric surgery as a means to address the severe implications of her obesity.</data>
