    <edge source="PACIENTE" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL TOTAL">
      <data key="d8">24.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The patient has been receiving total parenteral nutrition (TPN) as nutritional support due to her medical condition. This intervention was initiated after the patient lost her nasoenteric tube, which was previously used for nutritional delivery. Additionally, the patient required TPN due to complications that arose during her recovery, which further hindered her ability to maintain adequate nutrition orally. Overall, TPN has been essential in addressing the patient's nutritional needs during this challenging period.</data>
      <data key="d10">17b7995dcf275c50629c7e3d4723882e,449d46789f604265753884e2d371ec8c,e70fa2e099766154321f13c0112d436a,efe29025266e1689abb9b0a2783e5ea3</data>
