    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="PANCREATITIS AGUDA">
      <data key="d8">14.0</data>
      <data key="d9">NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL is a medical intervention that may be required for patients suffering from PANCREATITIS AGUDA, particularly in cases where these patients are unable to consume food orally. This form of nutrition is essential when enteral nutrition proves to be inadequate for meeting the nutritional needs of individuals with acute pancreatitis.</data>
      <data key="d10">57d361381e6ea4ddbc948891f9645009,88dcf64f61e33adc3702b1ec401e2d4e</data>
      <data key="d11">f2de12aeae624e03b6b7a94aa88d97fb</data>
      <data key="d12">866</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL (NP)">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Parenteral nutrition is a method of providing nutrients when enteral nutrition is inadequate</data>
      <data key="d10">57d361381e6ea4ddbc948891f9645009</data>
      <data key="d11">3df417c761fb4df98f4bc568741f1b90</data>
      <data key="d12">867</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NECESIDAD DE CIRUG&#205;A">
      <data key="d8">6.0</data>
      <data key="d9">La necesidad de cirug&#237;a en pacientes con pancreatitis aguda puede llevar a la administraci&#243;n de nutrici&#243;n parenteral si la enteral no es viable.</data>
      <data key="d10">5d4476c2c40af44f9d54628af0ac463d</data>
      <data key="d11">404eb827fb774fa8b10a533152edf915</data>
      <data key="d12">868</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="ASPEN">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
      <data key="d9">ASPEN establishes guidelines for the use of parenteral nutrition in patients with severe diarrhea and other conditions</data>
      <data key="d10">896ddfd9f06dc3ec8b1cfb986fae97fe</data>
      <data key="d11">57842af8239b4741802b621cc2a3237a</data>
      <data key="d12">869</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL" target="NUTRICI&#211;N PARENTERAL DOMICILIARIA">
      <data key="d8">5.0</data>
